  "alternatives": [
    "Keep the caller refs and transforms.ts: reject; six controls reproduce the same close-cause state machine and two copied insertion owners repeat 30 matcher/callback calls around existing canonical operations.",
    "Always focus the editor from DropdownMenuContent: reject; Escape, outside close, read-only mode changes and items opening another surface require provider-default or item-specific focus.",
